            "displayName": "Simon Willnauer",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "Updated patch which follows a slightly different approach. I build the codec ID record during segment flush since I learned the hard way that FieldInfo is maintained per IW session. I also added testcases including the ones from LUCENE-2740 an all test pass for me. \n\nReview and comments highly appreciated (marvin, mike? :) \n\nPS: I will leave the files support to LUCENE-2741 but this already provide the infrastructure...",
          "updateAuthor": {
